{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42091","headline":"留题胡参卿秀才幽居 · 李中","name":"留题胡参卿秀才幽居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹荫亭除藓色浓，道心安逸寂寥中。\n扣门时有栖禅客，洒酒多招采药翁。\n江近好听菱芡雨，径香偏爱蕙兰风。\n我慙名宦犹拘束，脱屣心情未得同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}